  "body": "## What changed\n\nA 2D Offset pass that starts Inside or Outside round a part with fixtures or clamps to avoid now passes an \\AirRoom\\ to \\Motion\\ (in \\pocket_avoid.rs\\).\n\n1. The avoid route constructs an \\AirRoom\\ joining the cutter-centre area with the air outside the stock box.\n2. The keep-outs of fixtures and clamps (grown by the tool radius) over the descent are subtracted using \\AirRoom::without\\.\n3. When fixtures stand on the plunge point or in the air lead, the entry moves off the fixture in air or stands down by name, without touching the obstacle.\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- \\camcraft-motion\\ lib: \\^Gvoid_route_entry_plunges_in_air_clear_of_a_clamp\\ verifies that with a clamp placed outside the stock box on the default plunge point, the path does not touch the clamp, and the entry either moves off it in air or stands down by name.\n- \\camcraft-motion\\ lib \\^Gir_entry::tests\\ (6 passed).\n\nChangelog: 2D Offset avoid route: pass air room with fixture keep-outs subtracted so the Arc entry plunges in air outside the stock box and leads in clear of clamps.\n\nFixes #3810",
